# 1. Tell GitHub: Rust and JavaScript are primary languages, include them in stats
*.rs linguist-language=Rust
*.js linguist-language=JavaScript

# 2. Exclude all documentation files from language stats 
# (READMEs and docs shouldn't count as code)
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation

# 3. Exclude third-party or minified files if you have any
# *.min.js linguist-vendored